  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Cooperation with other Conventions &amp; Organisations&quot; is the budget line approved by the World Heritage Committee under the World Heritage Fund for the period 2024-2025. It enables the Secretariat of the World Heritage Convention to participate in meetings with other Biodiversity-related (BLG) or Cultural (CCLG) Conventions, and to develop joint pilot projects within the UN system for a coordinated approach to the state of conservation or for the strengthening of management methods of World Heritage sites.</narrative>
